1091	chat-bd6521ae-8c7d-4319-9f4e-b13cbfa04731	step-04	read_file	{"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\simpleTables\\\\pyramid\\\\simpletables\\\\templates\\\\table.jinja2"}	{"ok": true, "path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\simpleTables\\\\pyramid\\\\simpletables\\\\templates\\\\table.jinja2", "size": 1335, "tool": "read_file", "sha256": "3ba82c93b62e48adad31849970ae6bec624b42f7babfed36cb7c6244dcb5a918", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\"en\\">\\n<head>\\n    <meta charset=\\"UTF-8\\">\\n    <meta name=\\"viewport\\" content=\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\">\\n    <title>Pretty Table</title>\\n    <link href=\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@3.4.5/dist/tailwind.min.css\\" rel=\\"stylesheet\\">\\n    <script src=\\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\\"></script>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n    <div class=\\"container mx-auto mt-10\\">\\n        <h1 class=\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\\">Results Table</h1>\\n        <div class=\\"overflow-x-auto\\">\\n            <table class=\\"table-auto w-full border-collapse border border-gray-400\\">\\n                <thead>\\n                    <tr>\\n                        {% for column in columns %}\\n                            <th class=\\"border border-gray-300 px-4 py-2\\">{{ column }}</th>\\n                        {% endfor %}\\n                    </tr>\\n                </thead>\\n                <tbody>\\n                    {% for row in data %}\\n                        <tr>\\n                            {% for column in columns %}\\n                                <td class=\\"border border-gray-300 px-4 py-2\\">{{ row[column] }}</td>\\n                            {% endfor %}\\n                        </tr>\\n                    {% endfor %}\\n                </tbody>\\n            </table>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n", "end_line": 35, "start_line": 1, "total_lines": 35}	f	2026-09-18 17:47:08.48059-04
1105	chat-bd6521ae-8c7d-4319-9f4e-b13cbfa04731	step-05	write_file	{"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\simpleTables\\\\README.md", "content": "# simpleTables\\n\\nA stock-data table viewer and Python web-framework comparison project. It reads ETF price CSV files (SPY, QQQ) from a local network share, processes them with pandas (concatenation + row-mean computation), and serves the results as a JSON API consumed by a Vue 3 single-page application.\\n\\nThe project is organized as a **client–server SPA + REST API** with three interchangeable Python backend implementations (Pyramid, Django, CherryPy-as-server) and two Vue frontend variants (UnoCSS-based primary, Flowbite/Tailwind-based secondary).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Directory Structure\\n\\n```\\nsimpleTables/\\n├── backend/                  # Django backend (alternative implementation)\\n│   ├── manage.py             #   Django CLI entry point\\n│   ├── db.sqlite3            #   SQLite database file\\n│   ├── backend/              #   Django project package\\n│   │   ├── settings.py       #     Settings (SQLite, CORS, static files)\\n│   │   ├── urls.py           #     Root URL conf (/admin/, /api/, /)\\n│   │   ├── wsgi.py\\n│   │   └── asgi.py\\n│   └── app/                  #   Django app (models, views, urls, admin)\\n│       ├── models.py         #     (empty — no models defined yet)\\n│       ├── views.py          #     sample_view (JSON), IndexView (template)\\n│       ├── urls.py           #     /api/sample/, /\\n│       ├── admin.py\\n│       ├── migrations/\\n│       └── static/\\n│\\n├── pyramid/                  # Pyramid backend (primary implementation)\\n│   ├── requirements.txt      #   Python dependencies\\n│   ├── setup.py              #   Package metadata & entry points\\n│   ├── README.txt            #   Pyramid quickstart instructions\\n│   ├── development.ini       #   Dev config (PostgreSQL, waitress, HTTPS)\\n│   ├── production.ini        #   Production config\\n│   ├── testing.ini           #   Test config\\n│   ├── pytest.ini            #   Pytest configuration\\n│   ├── simpletables/         #   Main Python package\\n│   │   ├── __init__.py       #     App factory: routes, CORS, static SPA serving\\n│   │   ├── routes.py         #     Route definitions (/table, /api/sample, etc.)\\n│   │   ├── pshell.py         #     IPython shell setup\\n│   │   ├── models/           #     SQLAlchemy ORM layer\\n│   │   │   ├── __init__.py   #       Session factory, pyramid_tm integration\\n│   │   │   ├── meta.py       #       Declarative Base\\n│   │   │   └── mymodel.py    #       MyModel (id, name, value)\\n│   │   ├── views/            #     View handlers\\n│   │   │   ├── table.py      #       Core logic: read CSVs → pandas → JSON\\n│   │   │   ├── default.py    #       Scaffold my_view\\n│   │   │   └── notfound.py   #       404 handler\\n│   │   ├── scripts/          #     Utility scripts\\n│   │   │   ├── cors.py       #       CORS tween factory\\n│   │   │   └── initialize_db.py  #  DB init console script\\n│   │   ├── templates/        #     Jinja2 templates (layout, table, 404)\\n│   │   ├── static/           #     Static assets (CSS, images)\\n│   │   └── alembic/          #     Alembic migration config & versions\\n│   │       ├── env.py\\n│   │       ├── script.py.mako\\n│   │       └── versions/\\n│   ├── tests/                #   Pytest suite\\n│   │   ├── conftest.py       #     Fixtures (app, dbsession, testapp)\\n│   │   ├── test_functional.py\\n│   │   └── test_views.py\\n│   └── certs/                #   Self-signed TLS certificates\\n│\\n├── cherryPy/                 # CherryPy as alternative WSGI server\\n│   ├── run.py                #   Loads Pyramid app, grafts onto CherryPy (port 6543, SSL)\\n│   └── certs/                #   Self-signed TLS certificates\\n│\\n├── vue/                      # Primary Vue 3 frontend (UnoCSS + TypeScript)\\n│   ├── package.json          #   Dependencies & scripts (dev/build/preview)\\n│   ├── pnpm-lock.yaml\\n│   ├── vite.config.ts        #   Vite config (UnoCSS, HTTPS dev server, port 6543)\\n│   ├── uno.config.ts         #   UnoCSS configuration\\n│   ├── tailwind.config.js\\n│   ├── tsconfig.json\\n│   ├── index.html\\n│   ├── src/\\n│   │   ├── main.ts           #     App bootstrap\\n│   │   ├── App.vue           #     Root component (nav, side panel, main view)\\n│   │   ├── style.css\\n│   │   ├── router/\\n│   │   │   └── index.ts      #     Routes: / (Home), /about\\n│   │   ├── views/\\n│   │   │   ├── HomeView.vue  #       Landing page (placeholder)\\n│   │   │   └── AboutView.vue\\n│   │   ├── components/\\n│   │   │   └── tableComponent.vue  #  Generic data-table renderer\\n│   │   ├── services/\\n│   │   │   └── api.js        #     Axios client → GET /table\\n│   │   ├── store/            #     Pinia stores (currently empty)\\n│   │   ├── composables/\\n│   │   │   └── layoutMain/   #     Layout components (topNav, sideNav, etc.)\\n│   │   └── assets/\\n│   ├── public/\\n│   ├── certs/                #   Self-signed TLS certificates (dev server)\\n│   └── dist/                 #   Build output (served by backends)\\n│\\n├── flowbite-vue/             # Secondary Vue 3 frontend (Flowbite + Tailwind starter)\\n│   ├── package.json\\n│   ├── vite.config.js\\n│   ├── src/\\n│   │   ├── main.js\\n│   │   ├── App.vue           #     Flowbite component showcase\\n│   │   ├── router/\\n│   │   └── views/            #     Demo views (accordion, carousel, modal, etc.)\\n│   └── ...\\n│\\n├── serve/                    # Prebuilt frontend bundle for Django\\n│   └── static/\\n│       ├── index.html\\n│       ├── assets/\\n│       └── favicon.ico\\n│\\n├── start_django.ps1          # Launch script: build Vue → copy to serve/ → Django runserver\\n├── start_pyramid.ps1         # Launch script: build Vue → pserve development.ini\\n└── .idea/                    # JetBrains IDE metadata\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n\\n### Frontend (vue/)\\n\\n| Package | Purpose |\\n|---------|---------|\\n| Vue 3.3 | UI framework |\\n| Vite 5 | Build tool / dev server |\\n| TypeScript 5.5 | Type safety |\\n| UnoCSS 0.61 | Atomic CSS (primary styling) |\\n| Pinia 2 | State management |\\n| Vue Router 4 | Client-side routing |\\n| Axios 1.7 | HTTP client |\\n| Chart.js 4 + vue-chartjs | Chart rendering |\\n| Flowbite 2.4 | UI component library |\\n| daisyUI 4 | Tailwind plugin |\\n| vue-i18n 9 | Internationalization |\\n| vue-slider-component | Slider inputs |\\n| vue3-perfect-scrollbar | Scrollbar styling |\\n\\n### Backend — Pyramid (primary)\\n\\n| Package | Purpose |\\n|---------|---------|\\n| Pyramid | WSGI web framework |\\n| SQLAlchemy | ORM / database access |\\n| Alembic | Database migrations |\\n| pyramid_tm + transaction | Transaction management |\\n| pyramid_retry | Retry logic |\\n| pyramid_jinja2 | Template rendering |\\n| pyramid_debugtoolbar | Development toolbar |\\n| waitress | Production WSGI server |\\n| psycopg2 | PostgreSQL driver |\\n| pandas | CSV data processing |\\n| WebTest + pytest + pytest-cov | Testing |\\n\\n### Backend — Django (alternative)\\n\\n| Package | Purpose |\\n|---------|---------|\\n| Django 5 | Web framework |\\n| django-cors-headers | CORS support |\\n| SQLite 3 | Database (file-based) |\\n\\n### Backend — CherryPy (alternative server)\\n\\n| Package | Purpose |\\n|---------|---------|\\n| CherryPy | WSGI server (wraps the Pyramid app) |\\n| paste.deploy | App loading |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Configuration & Environment\\n\\n### Pyramid (`pyramid/development.ini`)\\n\\n| Setting | Value (dev) | Notes |\\n|---------|-------------|-------|\\n| `sqlalchemy.url` | `postgresql://postgres:***@localhost:15432/defact` | PostgreSQL; a SQLite fallback is commented out |\\n| Server host | `0.0.0.0` | |\\n| Server port | `6543` | |\\n| `url_scheme` | `https` | Self-signed certs in `pyramid/certs/` |\\n| `pyramid.reload_templates` | `true` | Dev only |\\n| `pyramid_debugtoolbar` | enabled | Dev only |\\n\\n### Django (`backend/backend/settings.py`)\\n\\n| Setting | Value | Notes |\\n|---------|-------|-------|\\n| `DATABASES` | SQLite `db.sqlite3` | File-based, no external DB needed |\\n| `DEBUG` | `True` | |\\n| `CORS_ORIGIN_WHITELIST` | `http://localhost:8080` | Vue dev server origin |\\n| `SECRET_KEY` | placeholder | Replace before production |\\n\\n### Vue dev server (`vue/vite.config.ts`)\\n\\n| Setting | Value | Notes |\\n|---------|-------|-------|\\n| Port | `6543` | Matches backend port |\\n| HTTPS | enabled | Self-signed certs in `vue/certs/` |\\n| Alias `@` | `./src` | |\\n\\n### Data source (hardcoded in `pyramid/simpletables/views/table.py`)\\n\\n| Item | Value |\\n|------|-------|\\n| Network path | `\\\\\\\\KH-CA8D\\\\Local1675\\\\stocks-data` |\\n| Files | `QQQ.csv`, `SPY.csv` |\\n\\n> **Note:** The data path and CSV filenames are hardcoded. To use different data, edit `views/table.py`.\\n\\n### Environment variables\\n\\nNo `.env` files or environment-variable-based configuration were found. All configuration is in INI files (Pyramid), `settings.py` (Django), and `vite.config.ts` (Vue).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## How to Run / Build / Test\\n\\n### Prerequisites\\n\\n- Python 3.12+ (with `venv`)\\n- Node.js 18+ with **pnpm**\\n- PostgreSQL (for Pyramid) or none (Django uses SQLite)\\n- Self-signed TLS certificates in `pyramid/certs/`, `cherryPy/certs/`, and `vue/certs/`\\n\\n### Option A: Pyramid backend (primary)\\n\\n```bash\\ncd pyramid\\n\\n# 1. Create and activate a virtual environment\\npython -m venv env\\nenv\\\\Scripts\\\\activate        # Windows\\n# source env/bin/activate   # Linux/macOS\\n\\n# 2. Install dependencies\\npip install --upgrade pip setuptools\\npip install -e \\".[testing]\\"\\n\\n# 3. Initialize the database\\nalembic -c development.ini revision --autogenerate -m \\"init\\"\\nalembic -c development.ini upgrade head\\ninitialize_simpletables_db development.ini\\n\\n# 4. Build the Vue frontend\\ncd ../vue\\npnpm install\\npnpm run build\\ncd ..\\n\\n# 5. Run the server (serves Vue SPA + API on port 6543, HTTPS)\\ncd pyramid\\npserve development.ini\\n```\\n\\nOr use the launch script (note: it contains a hardcoded base path that may need updating):\\n\\n```powershell\\n.\\\\start_pyramid.ps1\\n```\\n\\n### Option B: Django backend (alternative)\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Build the Vue frontend\\ncd vue\\npnpm install\\npnpm run build\\ncd ..\\n\\n# 2. Copy build output to Django static\\n#    (start_django.ps1 does this automatically, or copy vue/dist/* → serve/static/)\\n\\n# 3. Run Django\\ncd backend\\npython manage.py migrate\\npython manage.py collectstatic --noinput\\npython manage.py runserver\\n```\\n\\nOr use the launch script:\\n\\n```powershell\\n.\\\\start_django.ps1\\n```\\n\\n### Option C: CherryPy server (wraps the Pyramid app)\\n\\n```bash\\ncd cherryPy\\npython run.py\\n# Serves the Pyramid app on 0.0.0.0:6543 with SSL\\n```\\n\\n### Frontend dev server (hot-reload)\\n\\n```bash\\ncd vue\\npnpm install\\npnpm dev\\n# Opens https://localhost:6543 (self-signed cert)\\n```\\n\\n### Running tests\\n\\n```bash\\ncd pyramid\\npytest\\n# or with coverage:\\npytest --cov\\n```\\n\\nThe test suite (`tests/`) uses WebTest + pytest with fixtures for the Pyramid app, database session, and transaction management.\\n\\n### Build the frontend for production\\n\\n```bash\\ncd vue\\npnpm run build\\n# Output: vue/dist/\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Architecture Summary\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│  Vue 3 SPA (vue/)                                           │\\n│  Router → HomeView / AboutView → tableComponent             │\\n│  services/api.js → axios GET /table                         │\\n└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘\\n                           │  HTTP (port 6543, HTTPS)\\n┌──────────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐\\n│  Python Backend                                              │\\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │\\n│  │ Pyramid (primary) / Django (alt) / CherryPy (server)│    │\\n│  │                                                     │    │\\n│  │ views/table.py:                                     │    │\\n│  │   read SPY.csv + QQQ.csv from network share         │    │\\n│  │   → pandas concat + mean_column                     │    │\\n│  │   → JSON array response                             │    │\\n│  │                                                     │    │\\n│  │ Serves built Vue SPA (vue/dist) as static files     │    │\\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │\\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n```\\n\\n**Current maturity:** The Pyramid backend contains the functional data-processing logic. The Vue frontend is in an early/demo state — `HomeView` is a static placeholder and `tableComponent` exists but is not yet wired into a view. The Django backend is a minimal parallel implementation.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Known Caveats\\n\\n- `start_pyramid.ps1` hardcodes a stale base path (`E:\\\\Shared_LOCAL\\\\Open-Share\\\\Docker\\\\simpleTables`) and venv path — update before use.\\n- `start_django.ps1` points the Django project at `serve/` rather than `backend/` — path mismatch.\\n- The data source path (`\\\\\\\\KH-CA8D\\\\Local1675\\\\stocks-data`) is hardcoded and machine-specific.\\n- `SECRET_KEY` in Django settings is a placeholder.\\n- CORS is set to `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` (development convenience, not production-safe).\\n"}	{"ok": true, "path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\simpleTables\\\\README.md", "tool": "write_file", "bytes": 14360, "sha256": "82c31a5e0498eaa902d4e21abbd32d4b9537e7d95e9b1e79abeda907575aaaf6", "created": true}	f	2026-09-18 17:56:20.867-04
