1151	chat-e233fdc6-1471-4b85-af2e-1e621b27d05c	step-03	write_file	{"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\README.md", "content": "# cors-dummy\\n\\nA lightweight CORS testing and demo project. It pairs a Python FastAPI backend (with a Flask alternative) that exposes a small JSON API with permissive CORS headers, and a Vue 3 frontend that makes cross-origin HTTP requests to verify browser CORS behavior against local and remote services.\\n\\nThe project was built to test how browsers handle cross-origin requests — particularly against services on the `kh22` Tailscale host — and to provide a simple backend that any origin can call.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Directory Structure\\n\\n```\\ncors-dummy/\\n├── .idea/                          # JetBrains IDE configuration (data sources, inspection profiles, workspace)\\n├── backend/\\n│   ├── alembic/                    # Alembic migration scripts (top-level copy)\\n│   │   ├── versions/\\n│   │   │   └── 4c3764355411_initial_migration.py   # Creates \\"items\\" table; drops legacy tables\\n│   │   ├── env.py\\n│   │   ├── README\\n│   │   └── script.py.mako\\n│   ├── app/\\n│   │   ├── alembic/                # Second Alembic copy (inside app package)\\n│   │   │   ├── versions/\\n│   │   │   ├── env.py\\n│   │   │   ├── README\\n│   │   │   └── script.py.mako\\n│   │   ├── tests/\\n│   │   │   └── sql.py              # Simple DB connection test script\\n│   │   ├── __init__.py\\n│   │   ├── alembic.ini             # Alembic config (placeholder DB URL)\\n│   │   ├── crud.py                 # CRUD helper: get_item()\\n│   │   ├── database.py             # SQLAlchemy engine/session setup (PostgreSQL)\\n│   │   ├── dynamic-scripts.py      # Reflects DB schema; returns unique values, table/column names\\n│   │   ├── flask_main.py           # Flask alternative entry point (port 15552)\\n│   │   ├── main.py                 # FastAPI entry point (port 15552, 4 workers)\\n│   │   ├── models.py               # SQLAlchemy model: Item (id, name)\\n│   │   └── schemas.py              # Pydantic schema: Item (id, name)\\n│   ├── data/                       # (empty; reserved for local data files)\\n│   ├── alembic.ini                 # Alembic config with actual DB URL\\n│   └── requirements.txt            # Python dependencies\\n└── frontend/\\n    ├── .vscode/                    # VS Code settings\\n    ├── dist/                       # Compiled production build (static site)\\n    ├── e2e/\\n    │   └── vue.spec.js             # Playwright end-to-end test\\n    ├── node_modules/               # Installed JS dependencies\\n    ├── public/\\n    │   └── favicon.ico\\n    ├── src/\\n    │   ├── assets/\\n    │   │   ├── base.css\\n    │   │   ├── logo.svg\\n    │   │   └── main.css\\n    │   ├── components/\\n    │   │   ├── __tests__/          # Vitest unit tests\\n    │   │   ├── icons/              # SVG icon components\\n    │   │   ├── HelloWorld.vue\\n    │   │   ├── TheWelcome.vue\\n    │   │   └── WelcomeItem.vue\\n    │   ├── router/\\n    │   │   └── index.js            # Vue Router: /, /about, /index\\n    │   ├── stores/\\n    │   │   └── counter.js          # Pinia counter store (demo)\\n    │   ├── views/\\n    │   │   ├── AboutView.vue       # Static about page\\n    │   │   ├── HomeView.vue        # Fetches random company info via cross-origin request\\n    │   │   └── indexView.vue       # Checks DB tables / fetches random rows via cross-origin request\\n    │   ├── App.vue                 # Root component with nav (Home, About, Index)\\n    │   └── main.js                 # App bootstrap: Vue, Pinia, Router, Axios\\n    ├── .eslintrc.cjs\\n    ├── .gitignore\\n    ├── .prettierrc.json\\n    ├── HOSTING_README.md           # Notes on deploying the built frontend\\n    ├── index.html\\n    ├── jsconfig.json\\n    ├── package.json\\n    ├── playwright.config.js\\n    ├── pnpm-lock.yaml\\n    ├── README.md                   # Frontend-specific setup instructions\\n    ├── vite.config.js              # Vite config: dev server on port 4665, host: true\\n    └── vitest.config.js\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Dependencies & Tech Stack\\n\\n### Backend (Python)\\n\\n| Package | Purpose |\\n|---------|---------|\\n| `fastapi` | Web framework (primary entry point) |\\n| `uvicorn` | ASGI server |\\n| `sqlalchemy` | ORM / database access |\\n| `alembic` | Database migrations |\\n| `pydantic` | Request/response validation schemas |\\n| `psycopg2-binary` | PostgreSQL driver |\\n\\nThe Flask alternative (`flask_main.py`) additionally requires `flask` and `flask-cors` (not listed in `requirements.txt` but imported in the code).\\n\\n### Frontend (JavaScript / Vue)\\n\\n| Package | Purpose |\\n|---------|---------|\\n| `vue` (3.x) | UI framework |\\n| `vue-router` (4.x) | Client-side routing |\\n| `pinia` (2.x) | State management |\\n| `axios` (1.x) | HTTP client for cross-origin requests |\\n| `vite` (5.x) | Dev server & build tool |\\n| `vitest` | Unit testing |\\n| `@playwright/test` | End-to-end testing |\\n| `eslint` + `prettier` | Linting & formatting |\\n\\n### Database\\n\\nPostgreSQL (local instance on port `15432`, database `defact`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Configuration & Environment\\n\\nAll configuration is **hardcoded** in source files; no `.env` files or environment variables are used.\\n\\n| Setting | Value | Location |\\n|---------|-------|----------|\\n| Database URL | `postgresql://postgres:<password>@localhost:15432/defact` | `backend/app/database.py`, `backend/app/dynamic-scripts.py`, `backend/alembic.ini` |\\n| Backend port | `15552` | `backend/app/main.py`, `backend/app/flask_main.py` |\\n| Frontend dev port | `4665` | `frontend/vite.config.js` |\\n| CORS policy | `allow_origins=['*']`, all methods, all headers, credentials enabled | `backend/app/main.py` (FastAPI), `backend/app/flask_main.py` (Flask) |\\n\\n> **Note:** The database password in the source is a local development placeholder. Do not commit real credentials.\\n\\n### CORS Origins List (defined but overridden)\\n\\n`main.py` defines an `origins` list with specific local and Tailscale addresses, but the actual middleware call uses `allow_origins=['*']`, making the list effectively unused. This is intentional for a CORS testing project.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## How to Install & Run\\n\\n### Prerequisites\\n\\n- Python 3.9+\\n- Node.js 18+ with pnpm\\n- A running PostgreSQL instance on `localhost:15432` with database `defact`\\n\\n### Backend (FastAPI — primary)\\n\\n```bash\\ncd backend\\npip install -r requirements.txt\\n\\n# Run the FastAPI server on port 15552\\npython app/main.py\\n```\\n\\nThe server starts with 4 Uvicorn workers. Available endpoints:\\n\\n| Method | Path | Description |\\n|--------|------|-------------|\\n| GET | `/` | Health check → `{\\"Hello\\": \\"World\\"}` |\\n| GET | `/items/{item_id}` | Fetch a single item by ID from the `items` table |\\n| GET | `/unique-values/{table_name}/{column_name}` | Return distinct values from any DB column |\\n\\n### Backend (Flask — alternative)\\n\\n```bash\\ncd backend\\npip install flask flask-cors\\npython app/flask_main.py\\n```\\n\\nSame endpoints, served by Flask on port `15552` in debug mode.\\n\\n### Frontend\\n\\n```bash\\ncd frontend\\npnpm install\\npnpm dev\\n```\\n\\nThe Vite dev server starts on `http://localhost:4665` (bound to all interfaces).\\n\\n### Production Build\\n\\n```bash\\ncd frontend\\npnpm build\\n```\\n\\nOutput is written to `frontend/dist/` and can be served by any static file server (Apache, Nginx, Uvicorn, etc.). For SPA routing, configure a fallback to `index.html`.\\n\\n### Tests\\n\\n```bash\\n# Frontend unit tests\\ncd frontend && pnpm test:unit\\n\\n# Frontend e2e tests (requires Playwright browsers)\\ncd frontend && npx playwright install && pnpm test:e2e\\n\\n# Backend DB connection check\\ncd backend && python app/tests/sql.py\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Key Observations\\n\\n- **Purpose:** The project exists to verify that browser CORS preflight and actual requests succeed against permissive backends and remote Tailscale-hosted services.\\n- **Frontend cross-origin calls:** `HomeView.vue` calls `http://kh22.boga-dace.ts.net:16618/company-info/random`; `indexView.vue` calls `http://kh22.boga-dace.ts.net:41651/check-table` and `/random-rows`. These are external services, not the local backend.\\n- **Two Alembic copies:** Both `backend/alembic/` and `backend/app/alembic/` exist. The top-level one (`backend/alembic.ini`) has the real DB URL; the inner one (`backend/app/alembic.ini`) has a placeholder.\\n- **No root-level manifest:** There is no `package.json`, `pyproject.toml`, or monorepo tooling at the project root. Backend and frontend are independent.\\n"}	{"ok": true, "path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\README.md", "tool": "write_file", "bytes": 8730, "sha256": "935ad8e5c4bf729c6cb285bd8e9f4edc0b0c7bff45bb9b685a2c333464058daa", "created": true}	f	2026-09-18 23:18:53.435566-04
