1200	chat-b3b685f9-127b-4a73-a75a-17befa08358b	step-01	read_file	{"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\HOSTING_README.md"}	{"ok": true, "path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\HOSTING_README.md", "size": 1166, "tool": "read_file", "sha256": "128fa44d01f0b154ff2ba295f2456b9ca4a6a780685c8e1839891a0c4c410dcc", "content": "# cors-dummy frontend: structure and hosting\\n\\n## Purpose\\n\\nThis Vue 3/Vite frontend was built to test browser CORS requests against services on the `kh22` host. It is the strongest match for the project remembered as having been tested on a `kh...` HTML host or through XAMPP.\\n\\n## Structure\\n\\n- `src/`: editable Vue application\\n- `src/views/HomeView.vue`: requests random company information\\n- `src/views/indexView.vue`: checks database tables and requests random rows\\n- `vite.config.js`: Vite configuration; development port is `4665`\\n- `dist/`: compiled static site to publish\\n\\n## Known services\\n\\nThe source contains hard-coded HTTP calls to:\\n\\n- `http://kh22.boga-dace.ts.net:16618/company-info/random`\\n- `http://kh22.boga-dace.ts.net:41651/check-table`\\n- `http://kh22.boga-dace.ts.net:41651/random-rows`\\n\\nThese endpoints must be reachable and allow the deployed site's origin. If the page is served over HTTPS, browsers may block these HTTP calls as mixed content.\\n\\n## Build and hosting\\n\\nRun `pnpm build` to regenerate `dist`. Node is only needed for building. Apache/XAMPP or Uvicorn can serve `dist`; browser-history routes need a fallback to `dist/index.html`.\\n\\n", "end_line": 28, "start_line": 1, "total_lines": 28}	f	2026-09-19 02:45:47.081672-04
