1281	child-22f79375-009e-4528-b2b6-6b6d27510d55	work	read_file	{"path": "C:\\\\Users\\\\KHzz\\\\Documents\\\\Norm\\\\docs\\\\recovery-notes\\\\chat-44b0e0ba-0234-4891-9ba8-59e33431b4c2\\\\step-02.md"}	{"ok": true, "path": "C:\\\\Users\\\\KHzz\\\\Documents\\\\Norm\\\\docs\\\\recovery-notes\\\\chat-44b0e0ba-0234-4891-9ba8-59e33431b4c2\\\\step-02.md", "size": 4131, "tool": "read_file", "sha256": "b20c85f3cc48557163e67d04d58765ccc19a19577432ec0bbb4606081b867ced", "content": "# Recovery Handoff — Step 2/9: Endpoint Loader & Validation\\n\\n**Parent task:** chat-44b0e0ba-0234-4891-9ba8-59e33431b4c2 / step-02\\n**Project root:** `D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy`\\n**Status:** Design complete. **Zero files written. Zero tests run.**\\n\\n## Immutable Scope (Step 2 ONLY)\\nWrite `backend/app/endpoints/loader.py` + tests. Do NOT implement app factory, metadata route, example endpoints, Vue, or any step 3+ work. No PostgreSQL/SQLAlchemy/Alembic/Flask. No `eval`/`exec`. ZIP `cors-dummy-original-20260919.zip` in live root must remain byte-identical.\\n\\n## Settled Design (implement exactly this)\\n\\n**File:** `backend/app/endpoints/loader.py`\\n\\n- `DiscoveredEndpoint` dataclass: `module_name: str`, `router: APIRouter`, `routes: list[tuple[str, str]]` (method, path).\\n- `EndpointDiscoveryError(Exception)` — all failure modes.\\n- `discover_endpoints(endpoints_dir: Path | str) -> list[DiscoveredEndpoint]`:\\n  1. Resolve dir; if missing → raise `EndpointDiscoveryError`.\\n  2. Scan `*.py`; skip `__init__.py` and names starting with `_`.\\n  3. Sort stems alphabetically (deterministic).\\n  4. Import via `importlib.import_module(f\\"app.endpoints.{stem}\\")`. Catch any exception → raise `EndpointDiscoveryError(f\\"Import failed for '{stem}': {exc}\\")`.\\n  5. Validate: `router = getattr(mod, \\"router\\", None)`; must be `isinstance(router, fastapi.APIRouter)`. Missing/wrong type → raise naming the module.\\n  6. Extract routes: for each `r in router.routes`, if `r.methods` is not None, yield `(m, r.path)` for each `m in r.methods`. Skip Mount/WebSocket (methods=None).\\n  7. Duplicate detection: dict `(method, path) → first_module`. Collision → raise naming both modules + conflicting route.\\n  8. Return list sorted by `module_name`.\\n\\n**Convention:** module exports exactly one `router` attr of type `APIRouter`. Multiple routers not supported; only `router` checked.\\n\\n## Test Plan (write `backend/tests/test_endpoint_loader.py`)\\n\\n| Case | Expectation |\\n|---|---|\\n| Valid module discovered | In result list |\\n| `_private.py` / `__init__.py` | Ignored |\\n| Missing `router` export | `EndpointDiscoveryError` naming module |\\n| Import failure (`import nonexistent_pkg`) | `EndpointDiscoveryError` with module name |\\n| Two modules, same method+path | `EndpointDiscoveryError` naming both |\\n| Same path, GET vs POST | Allowed, no error |\\n| `zeta`, `alpha`, `mid` → order | alpha, mid, zeta |\\n| Non-existent dir | `EndpointDiscoveryError` |\\n| Empty dir | `[]` |\\n| Source scan | No `eval(`, no `exec(` in loader source |\\n\\n**Fixture hygiene:** after each test, delete temp `.py` files from endpoints dir; purge `sys.modules` entries for `app.endpoints.*`. Ensure `sys.path` includes `backend/` before importing loader.\\n\\n## Exact Next Actions (in order)\\n1. Confirm/install FastAPI: `pip install fastapi` (or verify present).\\n2. Create `backend/app/__init__.py` (empty), `backend/app/endpoints/__init__.py` (empty).\\n3. Write `backend/app/endpoints/loader.py` per design above.\\n4. Write `backend/tests/test_endpoint_loader.py` per test plan above.\\n5. Run `pytest backend/tests/test_endpoint_loader.py -v`; iterate until green.\\n6. Grep loader source for `eval`/`exec` to confirm absence.\\n7. Git checkpoint commit.\\n\\n## Authoritative Constraints\\n- No `eval`, `exec`, or unsafe dynamic loading.\\n- No DB dependencies of any kind.\\n- No wildcard CORS (that's step 3+ anyway).\\n- ZIP integrity: verify hash before and after any work; do not modify.\\n- Loader must be importable standalone: `from app.endpoints.loader import discover_endpoints, EndpointDiscoveryError, DiscoveredEndpoint`.\\n\\n## Unresolved (minor, decide during implementation)\\n- Loader filename: `loader.py` (preferred) vs `discovery.py`. Use `loader.py`.\\n- Whether to accept a pre-built module-name list for test injection. Current: directory scan only; tests create real temp files.\\n\\n## What Must Happen Next (for this step)\\nImplement the loader + tests, run them green, verify no eval/exec, commit. Then hand off to step 3 (app factory, metadata route, example endpoints). Do not absorb step 3 work.", "end_line": 66, "start_line": 1, "total_lines": 66}	f	2026-09-19 11:26:44.048157-04
