op-in `/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/90-devbox.conf`: `PermitRootLogin no`, `PasswordAuthentication no`, `PubkeyAuthentication yes`, `X11Forwarding no`, `AllowUsers dev`. `mkdir -p /run/sshd` |\n| 12 | PATH ENV | `PATH="/opt/venv/bin:${PATH}"` |\n| 13 | EXPOSE | `22` (host maps 2222→22 via compose, not here) |\n| 14 | WORKDIR | `/home/dev/workspace` |\n| 15 | CMD | `["/usr/sbin/sshd","-D","-e"]` |\n\n## Authoritative Constraints\n- **Do NOT** set `USER dev` before CMD. Main process runs as root so sshd binds port 22. SSH sessions drop to `dev`. `docker exec` gives root; user can `su dev`.\n- PM2 `PM2_HOME` env var is **not** set here (step 03 concern). PM2 defaults to `~/.pm2` of invoking user.\n- PowerShell version = whatever Microsoft repo serves (7.4.x/7.5.x). Satisfies "PowerShell 7".\n- Node 24 LTS = "current stable". If user meant absolute latest (25), swap `setup_24.x`→`setup_25.x`.\n- `AllowUsers dev` is restrictive; easy to relax later.\n\n## Verification (step 02 exit criteria)\nDockerfile must contain:\n- Explicit `powershell` install line (layer 4)\n- Explicit `npm install -g pm2` line (layer 8)\n- All prior requirements present: Python 3.14, venv at `/opt/venv`, Node, pnpm, Bun, git, curl, build-essential, SSH server, non-root `dev` user, workspace dir\n- No prior requirement removed\n\n## Exact Next Action\n1. `mkdir -p devbox` (if not present)\n2. Write complete Dockerfile to **`devbox/Dockerfile`** following the layer table above\n3. Grep/verify: `grep -n 'powershell\\|pm2' devbox/Dockerfile` confirms both install lines\n4. Confirm no prior requirement is missing (checklist above)\n5. Return concise result. Do **not** present as final answer (steps 03–06 remain).\n\n## Source / DB Locators\n- No existing source files to reference. `devbox/` is empty.\n- No database involved in this step.\n- Parent task ID: `chat-9dcf1661-503d-47f8-8490-095c43ffdbf2`\n- Step ID: `step-02`\n\n## Unresolved / Watch Items\n- `python:3.14-bookworm` tag existence assumed (Oct 2025 release). Verify at build (step 06).\n- Node 24 vs 25: 24 chosen as LTS. Confirm with user if "latest" was intended.\n- No partial results exist. Nothing to carry forward beyond this note.	2026-09-20 12:28:54.290772-04	2026-09-20 12:28:54.290772-04
