ment` | Header reveal, viewport check, scroll setup, finance hover setup | Inline | One-time, no resize |\n| `scroll` | `document` | Sticky nav (`top` = scrollTop) | Inline `document.onscroll` | Replaces handlers, no throttle, no passive |\n| `mouseover` | 6 `.finance-button-item` elements | `indicator(e)` — reposition highlight box | Inline `addEventListener` | Not `mouseenter`, no `mouseleave`, no touch |\n| `click` | `#s2` checkbox | Toggle hamburger, hazy-black, `.blue-back` | Inline `$('#s2').click()` | Dead `.left-offsetter` line, split-brain with CSS |\n| `click` (programmatic) | `#s2` checkbox | Triggers above handler | Inline `$('#s2').click()` in ready | Coupled to viewport check |\n| `click` (native) | `<label>` wrapping `#s2` | Toggles checkbox natively | HTML | CSS handles menu show/hide |\n| `onclick` (inline) | 7 nav `<button>` elements | `location.href='#section'` | HTML attribute | Not semantic, not accessible as links |\n| `load` (jQuery AJAX) | `#div-resume` | Injects `resume.html` content + styles + broken script | Inline `$.load()` | 404 on `resumeSection.js`, global style leak, height bug |\n\n---\n\n### Bootstrap JS Usage\n\nBootstrap 5.2.3 bundle (CDN) provides two features used in the HTML:\n\n| Feature | HTML trigger | JS source |\n|---------|-------------|-----------|\n| **Collapse** (developer section accordions) | `data-bs-toggle="collapse"` on 3 buttons, `data-bs-parent="#div-developer"` on 3 panels | Bootstrap JS |\n| **Carousel** (customer service photos) | `data-bs-ride="carousel"`, `data-bs-slide="prev/next"`, `data-bs-slide-to="0/1/2/3"` | Bootstrap JS |\n\nBoth are standard Bootstrap 5 data-attribute APIs. No custom JS is needed for these. The local `js/bootstrap.*.js` files (6 copies, ~730 KB) are **never loaded** — the CDN copy is used.\n\n---\n\n### AOS.js (Animate On Scroll)\n\n- **23 KB** library in `js/AOS.js`.\n- **Never referenced** in any HTML file. No `<script>` tag, no `data-aos` attributes in the markup.\n- **Entirely dead.** Can be deleted.\n\n---\n\n### AngularJS Stubs\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| `js/myApp.js` | `var app = angular.module("myApp", []);` | **Dead** — AngularJS is not loaded, never referenced |\n| `js/myCtrl.js` | `// Using AngularJS` | **Dead** — comment only, never referenced |\n\nThese are remnants of an abandoned AngularJS approach. Neither file is loaded by any HTML page.\n\n---\n\n### Brittle / Redundant / Dead JS Summary\n\n| Issue | Location | Severity | Action |\n|-------|----------|----------|--------|\n| `document.onscroll` assignment (replaces handlers) | Inline, line 159 | **High** | Replace with `addEventListener('scroll', ..., { passive: true })` or CSS `position: sticky` |\n| No scroll throttling / `requestAnimationFrame` | Inline, lines 159–162 | **High** | Add rAF or use CSS sticky |\n| No `passive: true` on scroll | Inline, line 159 | **Medium** | Mobile scroll performance |\n| `mouseover` instead of `mouseenter` | Inline, line 172 | **Medium** | Redundant firings |\n| No `mouseleave` on finance buttons | Inline, lines 170–175 | **Medium** | Highlight sticks permanently |\n| No touch support for finance highlight | Inline, lines 170–175 | **Medium** | Inert on mobile |\n| `offsetLeft`/`offsetWidth` positioning | Inline, lines 165–167 | **Medium** | Fragile to DOM changes |\n| `$('.left-offsetter')` — no matching element | Inline, line 178 | **Low** | Dead code, remove |\n| `$('#s2').click()` programmatic trigger | Inline, line 153 | **Medium** | Coupled to toggle handler |\n| No resize handler for viewport check | Inline, lines 152–158 | **High** | One-time check, no update on resize/rotate |\n| `$.load()` injects broken `<script>` (404) | Inline, line 186 → `resume.html` line 51 | **High** | `resumeSection.js` missing |\n| `$.load()` injects global `<style>` (unscoped `h5`) | Inline, line 186 → `resume.html` lines 1–9 | **Medium** | Style leak, font not loaded |\n| Height calc: `this` = `#div-resume`, not `#ma