fication. Step 6 should present this as a self-contained, beginner-friendly final answer, include the transcription-uncertainty note from step 1, and not assume the reader has seen steps 1–5.	[]	A single discard is recommended with a clear, beginner-accessible justification that references the unseen-tile counts and hand structure.	\N	2026-09-16 00:37:35.224774-04	2026-09-16 00:38:12.615504-04
