T /assets/*.js` and `GET /assets/*.css` → 200 with expected sizes\\n\\n4. **Regression check:** `pytest tests/ -v` → **31 passed** in 0.63s.\\n\\n### Key design decisions\\n- Static mount is at `/assets` (matching Vite's output structure), not at `/` — this avoids shadowing API routes and keeps the SPA fallback explicit.\\n- The catch-all route is registered *after* all API routes, so FastAPI's route matching (first-match-wins) ensures `/api/*` is never intercepted.\\n- The `dist/` check is conditional: if the frontend hasn't been built, the app still starts (dev mode with Vite proxy).\\n\\nThis is an intermediate durable result, not the final answer. Ready for step-04 (.env.example, manifests, README).", "artifacts": [{"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\backend\\\\app\\\\main.py", "sha256": "ed2352f97bea876b21251c837265a4dcb3aa9fef9a59055ef151d37d3504364f", "verified": true}, {"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\backend\\\\verify_step3_static.py", "sha256": "865efaf4043d15b88837734ca1d25790029ac6351b1a0e06fb9a2bf8d538aa74", "verified": true}, {"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\__tests__\\\\HealthBadge.test.js", "sha256": "0071fd4422c5148bcda93cb49dd95de44fc529f96896807d70bc5f163969af9e", "verified": true}, {"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\__tests__\\\\RequestRunner.test.js", "sha256": "5f1c65c8cb491a65f295ff9a89371c5a8edc58ede2c8beb79fca8f493d66eff4", "verified": true}, {"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\__tests__\\\\RouteList.test.js", "sha256": "f05bd0bf79e3bebf554cb754fe6eee5e8fac79c3fb7c7c8ccc5e79217690d80c", "verified": true}, {"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\components\\\\RequestRunner.vue", "sha256": "3b3d33e66a26b11ac251cfbb551a2d16c69d5f5ebca884fa9a7f8ad0268109bb", "verified": true}], "verification_requirement": "pnpm bui