onst method = ref('GET')\\nconst path = ref('/health')   // was '/echo'\\nconst body = ref('')          // was '{\\"hello\\": \\"world\\"}'\\n```\\nRead back and confirmed (SHA-256 `3b3d33e6…`).\\n\\n### Evidence\\n- `pnpm install` succeeded (deps present).\\n- First run: 16 passed / 2 failed — both failures were the initial-state inconsistency above (discriminating: they failed because the component was wrong, not because of a test artifact).\\n- After repair: **3 test files passed, 18 tests passed, exit code 0.**\\n\\nThis is an intermediate durable result, not the final answer. Ready for step-03 (build Vue frontend and integrate FastAPI static/SPA serving).", "artifacts": [{"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\__tests__\\\\HealthBadge.test.js", "sha256": "0071fd4422c5148bcda93cb49dd95de44fc529f96896807d70bc5f163969af9e", "verified": true}, {"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\__tests__\\\\RequestRunner.test.js", "sha256": "5f1c65c8cb491a65f295ff9a89371c5a8edc58ede2c8beb79fca8f493d66eff4", "verified": true}, {"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\__tests__\\\\RouteList.test.js", "sha256": "f05bd0bf79e3bebf554cb754fe6eee5e8fac79c3fb7c7c8ccc5e79217690d80c", "verified": true}, {"path": "D:\\\\LOCAL_Share\\\\Code Projects\\\\cors-dummy\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\components\\\\RequestRunner.vue", "sha256": "3b3d33e66a26b11ac251cfbb551a2d16c69d5f5ebca884fa9a7f8ad0268109bb", "verified": true}], "verification_requirement": "Vitest run completes with all tests passing (exit code 0). Test output shows the specific test names for metadata display, health state, and request runner. If repairs were made, the repaired code is read back to confirm the fix.", "evidence_count": 50, "resource_status": {"context_state": "full", "message": "full context", "unresponsive_connections": []}}	[]	Vitest run completes with all tests passing (exit code 0). Test output s