l to watch:** SPY **762** on Sep 17. A close above it kills the primary; a close below 756 confirms it.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Accounting\\n\\nAll **32/32** raw paths dispositioned: 2 → Primary, 7 → Alt-1, 5 → Alt-2, 1 → Alt-3, 6 → Alt-4, 2 → Alt-5, 7 → subsumed into Primary, 2 → near-duplicate merge. No path dropped.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Evidence vs. Inference\\n\\n- **Chart-supported:** bearish structure, modest bid, QQQ outperformance.\\n- **Macro inference (not chart-confirmed):** M1 magnitude, M2 debt overhang, M3 yield channel, M4 foreign-holder channel, sector rotation. These affect *magnitude/duration*, not the *direction* the chart structure indicates.\\n\\n---\\n\\nNo pending actions. The synthesis file is ready for use.", "artifacts": [{"path": "C:\\\\Users\\\\KHzz\\\\Documents\\\\Norm\\\\docs\\\\SPY_QQQ_20260916_32_hypotheses_synthesized.md", "sha256": "b0d71cc8754e528217eb94d223841dc02c85e298b109107acb14131a537c504a", "verified": true}], "verification_requirement": "User receives a concise decision-useful summary with the verified file path and no pending actions.", "evidence_count": 8, "resource_status": {"context_state": "full", "message": "full context", "unresponsive_connections": []}}	[]	User receives a concise decision-useful summary with the verified file path and no pending actions.	\N	2026-09-16 19:59:54.450216-04	2026-09-16 20:05:33.987773-04
