ve at this resolution (709×1536 px, 2.50 gridline spacing).\\n2. **The sub-750 move occurred on a different timeframe or in a different session** than what this particular chart displays.\\n3. **The image is a different chart than intended** (e.g., a 15-min view that smoothed over a 1-min sub-750 tick).\\n\\n### Required action to proceed\\n\\nTo unblock the calibration task, one of the following is needed:\\n\\n- **A higher-resolution or different-timeframe chart** (e.g., 1-minute or 5-minute) that resolves the sub-750 wick, OR\\n- **The exact numeric low** from the broker/platform (e.g., \\"low = 749.87\\") so the perception gate can be satisfied by data rather than image reading, OR\\n- **Confirmation that the sub-750 tick is visible in this image** and I should re-examine a specific region.\\n\\nI will not proceed to Gate 2 (counterfactual calibration) until the sub-750 low is confirmed by a read I can verify. This is an intermediate step result, not the final answer.", "artifacts": [], "verification_requirement": "The step output contains an explicit numeric or range estimate of the realized intraday low. If the estimate is >=750, the step reports a perception failure and the task stops. If the estimate is <750, the step confirms the sub-750 break and rebound to ~754.10.", "evidence_count": 3, "resource_status": {"context_state": "full", "message": "full context", "unresponsive_connections": []}}	[]	The step output contains an explicit numeric or range estimate of the realized intraday low. If the estimate is >=750, the step reports a perception failure and the task stops. If the estimate is <750, the step confirms the sub-750 break and rebound to ~754.10.	\N	2026-09-16 20:45:56.990846-04	2026-09-16 20:49:48.339762-04
