4.69 at y≈514.5).\\n\\n### Other Locations Checked\\n\\n| Location | Finding |\\n|---|---|\\n| `C:\\\\Users\\\\KHzz\\\\Documents\\\\Norm\\\\docs\\\\` | No additional axis-transform artifacts (only the two spec files, cheat sheet, and SPY hypothesis docs) |\\n| `C:\\\\Users\\\\KHzz\\\\Documents\\\\Norm\\\\docs\\\\blocked-writes\\\\` | Contains only an HTML index file — no axis transforms |\\n| `C:\\\\Users\\\\KHzz\\\\Documents\\\\Norm\\\\staging\\\\` | Outside allowed roots — inaccessible |\\n| Background memory | Contains the prior transform values (listed above) — all marked excluded |\\n\\n### Summary for Step-03\\n\\n- **Image to calibrate:** `C:\\\\Users\\\\KHzz\\\\Documents\\\\Norm\\\\images\\\\norm images\\\\QQQ_followup_hidden_wick_test_20260916.jpg`\\n- **Excluded transforms:** The single prior mapping (pane-boundary-anchored, 61.083 px/unit, 700→y=887) and all its derived gridline positions.\\n- **Required fresh anchors (per gate):** Overnight 709.18 at ~y=298 and current-price 704.69 at ~y=514.5, refined from original pixels.\\n- **No other prior transforms exist** in accessible locations.\\n\\n*Step-02 complete. No image analysis or price conversion performed. Ready for step-03 (fresh axis calibration and gate enforcement).*", "artifacts": [], "verification_requirement": "The target image path is confirmed to exist. A list of prior axis transforms (if any) is identified and marked as excluded from this run.", "evidence_count": 6, "resource_status": {"context_state": "full", "message": "full context", "unresponsive_connections": []}}	[]	The target image path is confirmed to exist. A list of prior axis transforms (if any) is identified and marked as excluded from this run.	\N	2026-09-17 03:59:20.93011-04	2026-09-17 04:00:59.439436-04
chat-1d9e33f3-cab0-44f3-8f7b-3cf32241dcf1	step-03	Run fresh axis calibration and enforce gate	completed	{"schema_version": 2, "kind": "step_result", "status": "completed", "task_id": "chat-1d9e33f3-cab0-44f3-8f7b-3cf32241dcf1", "step_id": "step-03", "request_type": "step", "command_category": "task", "content": "Now I have both the geometric analyzer's precise line detection and the vision model's label identification. Let me perform the fresh axis calibration and evaluate against the gate criteria.\\n\\n## Fresh Axis Calibration\\n\\n**Primary labeled anchors (from current image only):**\\n\\n| Anchor | Price | Y position | Source |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Overnight line | 709.18 | y = 298.0 | Geometric analyzer (confidence 1.0, max_length 855) + vision confirms tag at y≈290-305 |\\n| Current price line | 704.69 | y = 514.75 | Geometric analyzer (max_length 422) + vision confirms tag at y≈500-515 |\\n\\n**Derived mapping:**\\n- Slope = (709.18 − 704.69) / (514.75 − 298.0) = 4.49 / 216.75 = **0.020715 price units/px** (48.27 px/unit)\\n- Formula: `price(y) = 709.18 − (y − 298) × 0.020715`\\n\\n**Verification against visible gridline labels (gate rule 6):**\\n\\n| Gridline | Predicted y | Observed y (analyzer) | Residual (px) | Residual (price) |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| 712.00 | 161.9 | 165.0 (length 234) | +3.1 | 0.06 |\\n| 702.00 | 644.6 | 644.5 (length 142) | −0.1 | 0.00 |\\n\\nBoth residuals are negligible. The 702.00 gridline match is essentially exact.\\n\\n**Critical check (gate rule 5):**\\n- 700.00 → y = 298 + (709.18 − 700.00) / 0.020715 = 298 + 443.2 = **y ≈ 741.2**\\n- This is NOT y=887 (the prior run's forbidden pane-bottom anchor). ✓\\n\\n## Gate Evaluation\\n\\n| Gate Rule | Requirement | Result | Evidence |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | No forbidden anchors (pane top/bottom, crop boundary, unlabeled lines) | ✅ PASS | Only labeled price tags used |\\n| 2 | Allowed anchors: explicit visible numeric labels | ✅ PASS | 709.18 and 704.69 are visible colored tags |\\n| 3 | Primary anchors at expected positions | ✅ PASS | 709.18@y=298 (expected ~298), 704.69@y=514.75 (expected ~514.5) |\\n| 4 | Slope ≈ 0.02074 units/px | ✅ PASS | Calculated 0.020715 (0.15% deviation) |\\n| 5 | 700.00 near y=741, NOT y=887 | ✅ PASS | 700.00 at y=741.2 |\\n| 6 | Gridline labels independently verified | ✅ PASS | 712.00@y=165 (res 0.06), 702.00@y=644.5 (res 0.00) |\\n| 7 | Residuals reported for every anchor | ✅ PASS | Max residual 0.06 price units |\\n| 8 | No material inconsistency | ✅ PASS | All residuals < 0.1 units |\\n| 9 | No prior transform reused | ✅ PASS | Fresh calculation from current image pixels |\\n| 10 | Gate must pass before conversion | ✅ PASS | All 10 criteria met |\\n\\n## **GATE RESULT: ✅ PASS**\\n\\nThe fresh axis transform is valid and ready for use in subsequent steps. No prior transform values were used. The prior run's error (pane-bottom y=887 → 700.00) is explicitly excluded and contradicted by this calibration.\\n\\n---\\n\\n*Step-03 complete. Fresh axis calibration computed from current image labeled anchors only. Gate PASSES all 10 criteria. Ready for step-04 (execute audit procedure per task spec). No price conversion of wick endpoints performed yet — that is step-04's scope.*", "artifacts": [], "verification_requirement": "A fresh axis transform is computed from the current image only. The gate criteria from QQQ_AXIS_GATE.md are explicitly checked and the pass/fail result is stated with supporting evidence (gridline positions, price labels, residual error).", "evidence_count": 8, "resource_status": {"context_state": "full", "message": "full context", "unresponsive_connections": []}}	[]	A fresh axis transform is computed from the current image only. The gate criteria from QQQ_AXIS_GATE.md are explicitly checked and the pass/fail result is stated with supporting evidence (gridline positions, price labels, residual error).	\N	2026-09-17 04:00:59.540636-04	2026-09-17 04:06:51.208351-04
