onsumer) | Implemented |\\n| `shared_queue.py` | `data_queue = queue.Queue()` | Implemented (shared state) |\\n| `porting_3step.py` | 3-step port: dedupe → create new table → transform JSONB→columns; placeholder `db_config` | Experimental/standalone |\\n| `step01-init.py` | 5-line stub importing `help_connect` | Stub |\\n\\n**Relationship to root:** root `move_and_partition_db.py` star-imports `help_connect`. Depends on external `kh_data.mong_access`.\\n\\n### 3. `restart_update_tickers/` — Alternate/restart intraday pipeline\\n**Purpose:** A reworked version of the intraday fetcher — pulls 1-min data per ticker into `finmo_prep.{ticker}_bulk`, with resume support (skips already-filled dates) and adaptive wait throttling.\\n\\n| File | Role | Status |\\n|------|------|--------|\\n| `main.py` | **Entry point** (largest, 8 KB): `date_intervals` → `fetch_all_data` (async) → `batch_insert`; per-ticker loop over `geta_ticker` | Implemented (wired) |\\n| `step_03_insert_to_db.py` | Same as pipeline version but adds a `url` column | Implemented |\\n| `gen_var.py` | Globals: `FIRST_TIME=2011`, `LAST_TIME=today`, `ticker=INTC`, `ITERATIONS=255`, URL templates, retries, `wait_gain` | Implemented (config) |\\n| `geta_ticker.py` | Random tickers from `company_info` (CS mcap>1B or ETF) via `kh_data.mong_access` | Implemented |\\n| `dates_from_db.py` | `get` distinct dates (resume/skip logic) | Implemented |\\n| `color_logs.py` | Local ANSI color-logging formatter (this dir's own copy) | Implemented (helper) |\\n| `cleanup.py` | Insert + delete empty responses; placeholder config | Experimental/standalone |\\n| `ticker_trans.py` | Column value-replacement helper; placeholder config | Experimental/standalone |\\n| `async_try.py` | Async fetch experiment; placeholder `API_URL` | Experiment |\\n\\n**Relationship to root:** independent of root `main.py`; depends on external `kh_data.mong_access`, `kh_data.strings_theory`.\\n\\n### Cross-cutting observations (evidence-based)\\n- **Two