115	chat-44b0e0ba-0234-4891-9ba8-59e33431b4c2	step-02	4		**Step 2/9 — Endpoint Loader & Validation (INCOMPLETE: design done, nothing written to disk)**\n\n**Goal:** `backend/app/endpoints/loader.py` (or equivalent) exposing `discover_endpoints(endpoints_dir: Path | str) -> list[DiscoveredEndpoint]`.\n\n**Design (settled):**\n- `DiscoveredEndpoint` dataclass: `module_name: str`, `router: APIRouter`, `routes: list[tuple[str, str]]` (method, path pairs).\n- Custom exception `EndpointDiscoveryError` for all failure modes.\n- Scan `endpoints_dir` for `*.py`; skip `__init__.py` and any name starting with `_`.\n- Import via `importlib.import_module(f"app.endpoints.{stem}")` — no eval/exec.\n- Validate: module must have attribute `router` that is `isinstance(..., fastapi.APIRouter)`. Missing or wrong type → raise `EndpointDiscoveryError` naming the module.\n- Import failure (any exception during import) → catch, raise `EndpointDiscoveryError` with module name + original exception.\n- Route extraction: iterate `router.routes`; for each `APIRoute` with non-None `methods`, yield `(method, path)` for each method. Guard: skip routes where `methods` is None (Mount, WebSocket, etc.).\n- Duplicate detection: dict `(method, path) → first_module_name`; on collision raise `EndpointDiscoveryError` naming both modules and the conflicting route.\n- Return list sorted by `module_name`.\n\n**Test plan (designed, NOT yet written):**\n- Valid module discovered; underscore-prefixed ignored; `__init__.py` excluded.\n- Missing `router` export → `EndpointDiscoveryError`.\n- Import failure (e.g. `import nonexistent_pkg`) → `EndpointDiscoveryError` with module name.\n- Two modules, same method+path → `EndpointDiscoveryError` naming both.\n- Same path, different methods (GET vs POST) → allowed, no error.\n- Deterministic sorted order (create `zeta`, `alpha`, `mid` → expect alpha, mid, zeta).\n- Non-existent directory → clear error. Empty directory → empty list.\n- Source scan: no `eval(`, no `exec(` in loader source.\n- Fixture: after each test, remove temp `.py` files from endpoints dir and purge `sys.modules` entries for `app.endpoints.*`.\n- `sys.path` must include `backend/` before importing loader.\n\n**NOT done / NOT verified:**\n- No files created. No code executed. No tests run.\n- FastAPI may not yet be installed in the working env (notes say "I need to install FastAPI first").\n- `backend/app/__init__.py` and `backend/app/endpoints/__init__.py` not yet created.\n\n**Unresolved / open:**\n- Whether a module exporting multiple routers should be rejected or only the `router` attr checked. Current decision: check only `router`; document convention.\n- Exact file name for the loader module (`loader.py` vs `discovery.py` vs `registry.py`). Notes lean toward `loader.py`.\n- Whether `discover_endpoints` should also accept a pre-built list of module names (for test injection) or strictly scan a directory. Current: directory scan only; tests create real temp files.\n\n**Exact next actions (in order):**\n1. `pip install fastapi` (or confirm already present).\n2. Create `backend/app/__init__.py`, `backend/app/endpoints/__init__.py`.\n3. Write `backend/app/endpoints/loader.py` per design above.\n4. Write `backend/tests/test_endpoint_loader.py` per test plan above.\n5. Run `pytest backend/tests/test_endpoint_loader.py -v`; fix until green.\n6. Grep loader source for `eval`/`exec` to confirm absence.\n7. Commit checkpoint.\n\n**Constraint reminders:**\n- Step 2 only. Do not implement app factory, metadata route, example endpoints, or Vue (steps 3+).\n- No PostgreSQL/SQLAlchemy/Alembic/Flask anywhere.\n- No eval or unsafe loading.\n- ZIP `cors-dummy-original-20260919.zip` must remain untouched.	8000	2026-09-19 11:24:54.536613-04	2026-09-19 13:04:50.122863-04
