149	child-2c72b67e-6a57-4abb-8e44-ed58872cb964	work	10		**Continuation Note — `backend/app/endpoints/loader.py`**\n\n**Task (settled design, not yet implemented):**\nWrite `backend/app/endpoints/loader.py` containing:\n- `DiscoveredEndpoint` dataclass: `module_name: str`, `router: APIRouter`, `routes: list[tuple[str, str]]` (method, path).\n- `EndpointDiscoveryError(Exception)`.\n- `discover_endpoints(endpoints_dir: Path | str) -> list[DiscoveredEndpoint]`:\n  1. Resolve dir; if missing → raise `EndpointDiscoveryError`.\n  2. Scan `*.py`; skip `__init__.py` and underscore-prefixed stems.\n  3. Sort stems alphabetically.\n  4. `importlib.import_module(f"app.endpoints.{stem}")`; catch any exception → `EndpointDiscoveryError` naming the module.\n  5. Validate exactly one `router` attr of type `fastapi.APIRouter`; missing or wrong type → raise naming the module.\n  6. Extract routes; skip entries where `method is None` (Mount / WebSocket).\n  7. Detect duplicate `(method, path)` across modules; on collision raise naming both modules and the conflicting route.\n  8. Return list sorted by `module_name`.\n- Constraints: no eval/exec, no DB, no step-3+ code.\n\n**Design tension identified (unresolved):**\n`loader.py` resides in `app/endpoints/` — the same directory `discover_endpoints` scans. The skip rules (`__init__.py`, underscore-prefixed) do not exclude `loader.py`. Since `loader.py` exports no `router`, step 5 would raise `EndpointDiscoveryError` on the loader itself, making discovery of any real endpoint module impossible.\n\n**Options considered (neither chosen):**\n- A) Move the loader to `app/loader.py` (outside the scanned package). Violates the explicit file-path requirement.\n- B) Add a special-case skip for the loader's own stem (e.g., skip `stem == "loader"` or compare against `__name__`). Adds an exclusion rule not in the settled spec.\n\n**Unresolved question:**\nDoes the settled design intend the loader to be excluded from its own scan (implying an implicit self-skip), or is the file-path requirement to be relaxed? No decision recorded.\n\n**Exact next work:**\n1. Resolve the self-scan question (ask user or re-read upstream spec for a clause covering it).\n2. Once resolved, write `loader.py` per the 8-step contract above, incorporating whichever exclusion mechanism is chosen.\n3. Write a minimal test: create a temp `endpoints/` dir with two valid modules (one with a duplicate route to exercise collision detection), one module missing `router`, one with a non-APIRouter `router`, and one with a `method=None` route; assert correct return list and correct exception messages.\n4. Run the test; verify no import side-effects leak.\n\n**Status:** No file written. No code drafted. No tests run. Blocked on the self-scan design question.	16000	2026-09-19 11:47:32.826412-04	2026-09-19 12:24:06.737255-04
