413	chat-9dcf1661-503d-47f8-8490-095c43ffdbf2	step-02	2		**DURABLE CONTINUATION NOTE — Step 02/6: Devbox Dockerfile (PM2 + PowerShell 7)**\n\n**State:** `devbox/` is empty. No Dockerfile exists. Must create from scratch. The extensive planning below was completed in thinking but **the file was never written to disk**.\n\n**Scope (step 02 only):** Create `devbox/Dockerfile` with all prior requirements + explicit PowerShell 7 install + global PM2 install. Do NOT add: build-time `pwsh --version`/`pm2 --version` checks (step 04), PM2 persistence mounts in compose/.env (step 03), README docs (step 05), or final validation (step 06).\n\n**Decisions locked in:**\n\n- **Base:** `python:3.14-bookworm` (Debian 12). Fallback: `python:3.14` if tag missing.\n- **System pkgs (layer 1):** `build-essential ca-certificates curl wget git openssh-server sudo tzdata libicu-dev libssl-dev python3-venv python3-dev`. Use `--no-install-recommends`, clean apt lists.\n- **PowerShell 7 (layer 2):** Microsoft apt repo for Debian 12: fetch `packages-microsoft-prod.deb` from `packages.microsoft.com/config/debian/12/`, `dpkg -i`, `apt-get update`, `apt-get install -y powershell`. Do NOT use `--no-install-recommends` here (safety).\n- **Node.js (layer 3):** NodeSource `setup_24.x` (current LTS as of late 2025). `curl -fsSL … | bash`, then `apt-get install -y nodejs`.\n- **pnpm (layer 4):** `npm install -g pnpm`.\n- **Bun (layer 5):** `ENV BUN_INSTALL=/usr/local` before install; `curl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash`. Lands at `/usr/local/bin/bun`.\n- **PM2 (layer 6):** `npm install -g pm2`. Global, available to all users.\n- **User + dirs (layer 7):** `dev` UID/GID 1000, home `/home/dev`, bash shell, passwordless sudo. Create `/home/dev/{workspace,.pm2,.pm2/logs,.ssh}` (ssh mode 700). `chown -R dev:dev /home/dev`.\n- **Venv (layer 8):** `python -m venv /opt/venv`, upgrade pip/setuptools/wheel, `chown -R dev:dev /opt/venv`. Chosen over `/home/dev/.venv` to avoid bind-mount shadowing at runtime.\n- **SSH config (layer 9):** Drop-in `/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/90-devbox.conf`: `PermitRootLogin no`, `PasswordAuthentication no`, `PubkeyAuthentication yes`, `X11Forwarding no`, `AllowUsers dev`. `mkdir -p /run/sshd`.\n- **ENV (layer 10):** `PATH="/opt/venv/bin:${PATH}"`. `DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive`, `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`, `PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1`, `PIP_NO_CACHE_DIR=1`.\n- **EXPOSE 22** (host maps 2222→22 via compose, not in Dockerfile).\n- **USER:** Do NOT set `USER dev` before CMD. Container main process runs as root so sshd can bind port 22. SSH sessions drop to `dev`. `docker exec` gives root; user can `su dev`.\n- **CMD:** `["/usr/sbin/sshd","-D","-e"]`.\n- **WORKDIR:** `/home/dev/workspace`.\n\n**Layer order (final):** base → ENV flags → system pkgs → PowerShell → Node → pnpm → Bun → PM2 → user/dirs → venv → SSH config → PATH ENV → EXPOSE → WORKDIR → CMD.\n\n**Unresolved / watch items:**\n- `python:3.14-bookworm` tag existence assumed (Oct 2025 release, Sept 2026 task date). Verify at build.\n- PowerShell version will be whatever Microsoft repo serves (7.4.x or 7.5.x). Satisfies "PowerShell 7".\n- Node 24 LTS chosen as "current/latest stable". If user meant absolute latest (25), swap `setup_24.x` → `setup_25.x`.\n- `AllowUsers dev` is restrictive; easy to relax later.\n- PM2 `PM2_HOME` env var NOT set in Dockerfile (that's step 03's persistence concern). PM2 will default to `~/.pm2` of the invoking user.\n\n**Exact next action:** Write the complete Dockerfile to `devbox/Dockerfile` following the layer plan above. No other files touched in this step. After writing, verify the file contains explicit `powershell` and `pm2` install lines and that no prior requirement (Python 3.14, venv, Node, pnpm, Bun, git, curl, build-essential, SSH, non-root user, workspace) is missing.	16000	2026-09-20 12:24:19.445296-04	2026-09-20 12:47:14.130332-04
